sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户 gandli
    participant TA as Telegram Bot API
    participant W as CF Worker<br/>(webhook handler)
    participant KV as KV CACHE
    participant CHAIN as 描述链<br/>deepwiki/zread/AI
    participant AI as Workers AI<br/>(Summarization)
    participant G as github.com/trending
    participant TG as telegra.ph
    participant WA as web.archive.org
    participant GH as GitHub 存档 repo

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over U,GH: 每日定时推送 (cron 08:30 北京时间)
    W->>W: runDigest()<br/>cache=miss 走全管线
    W->>+G: GET /trending
    G-->>-W: HTML → HTMLRewriter 解析 top10
    W->>+CHAIN: resolveDescriptions (10 仓)
    CHAIN-->>-W: 中文描述 (deepwiki/zread→AI 摘要→TranSmart)
    W->>W: renderMessage() → chunks
    W->>TA: sendPerRepoMessages()<br/>每仓一条 sendPhoto(OG 图 caption)
    TA-->>U: 📊 10 条, 各带 OG 卡+中文描述
    W->>KV: put digest:<date> (chunks+repos)
    W->>TG: createPage (Telegraph 备份)
    TG-->>W: page_url → put archive:tg:<date>
    W->>+GH: PUT archive/<YYYY>/<YYYY-MM-DD>.md
    GH-->>-W: commit
    end

    rect rgb(240,255,240)
    Note over U,GH: 手动命令 (webhook)
    U->>TA: /search rust
    TA->>+W: POST /telegram
    W->>W: 验签 → return 200 → ctx.waitUntil
    W->>KV: get search:index (6076 条)
    KV-->>W: 单键索引 (内存过滤命中 209)
    W->>W: 当页英文描述批量译中
    W->>TA: sendMessage + inline keyboard<br/>(上一页/页码/下一页 + 跳转)
    TA-->>U: 🔍 第1/21页 + 翻页按钮
    U-->>TA: 点下一页 callback arch:pg:1
    TA->>+W: callback_query
    W->>TA: editMessageText 同消息更新 + answerCallbackQuery
    TA-->>U: 第2/21页
    end

    rect rgb(255,250,235)
    Note over U,GH: 链接处理 + 三链存档
    U->>TA: github.com/basecamp/omarchy
    TA->>+W: POST /telegram
    W->>W: extractRepo → seenToday?
    W->>+CHAIN: lookupRepo (描述已缓存走 lookup:desc)
    CHAIN-->>-W: 描述 → renderMessage → sendPerRepoMessages(OG 图)
    W->>KV: put archive:idx:<repo>
    W->>+GH: PUT archive/<YYYY>/<date>.md
    GH-->>-W: commit
    W->>TA: 📁 三链: Telegraph · 互联网档案馆 · GitHub md
    TA-->>U: 存档卡 (OG 图 + 三链)
    end